= Friedrich Baltrusch

Friedrich Baltrusch is one of the leaders of the Young German Order and a close assocaite of the <span style="color: #000000;">**Center**</span>'s Adam Stegerwald.

- @organizing
- @union_unity
- @Improve_relations_center
- @root: Return to main

@organizing
title: Organizing workers
subtitle: Improve our standing among the workers.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; workers_dvp += 1*(1-dissent); new_middle_dvp += 3*(1-dissent); labor_strength += 2

We have increased our organizing among the workers.

@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Shift the party towards the liberal unions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_strength += 10; labor_dissent -= 8; industrialist_dissent += 5

We have reduced tensions with the Labor faction, and increased its strength in the party.

@Improve_relations_center
title: <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span> relations
subtitle: Improve our relations with the <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span>.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; z_relation += 5*(1 - dissent); z_relation += 4*(1 - dissent) if z_leader = "Stegerwald"

Baltrusch has used his connections to improve our standing with the <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span>.
